WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:02.750
- Okay, so things haven't gone our way yet,
but we can turn it around.

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.791
It's a long road ahead, and

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:06.000
GOLLY, IT’S ALREADY THE QUARTER SEASON CARNIVAL.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.875
- I want that prize.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.125
- Josh, get in the tank

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:11.375
or we'll find someone who will.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.125
- NEVER! JOSH DOBBS TO THE MOON!

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.041
- Yeah, lemme get one.

00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:19.916
- Comin’ right up.

00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:21.500
- Ugh!
- Total accident, dude.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.291
- Woo, yeah.

00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:24.166
- [Garrett Wilson:] We're just saying, Coach.

00:00:24.166 --> 00:00:26.125
Maybe you don't ride with Zach this time?

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.500
- Guys, he's right here.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.750
- Ow, it hurts my teeth.

00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:31.791
-  Let's see. Can't ride with anyone too good 
or I might upset Aaron.

00:00:31.791 --> 00:00:34.250
Can't ride with anyone terrible or my locker-room will kill me.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.791
Oh, my God. He's perfect.

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:38.416
- Coach?!

00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:39.375
Coach!?

00:00:39.541 --> 00:00:40.250
- [Announcer:] Attention.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:44.000
Will whoever’s in charge of Kyle
Pitts, please report to the Lost and Found?

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.916
He's been here for, like, three years.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.791
- AMANDA, AMBER, AMY... 

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:50.250
Who did that?

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:51.708
- Sorry, Coach told me to throw the-

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:56.958
My comments
about coaching were misconstrued. I'm sorry-

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.375
Man, I can't win.

00:01:00.375 --> 00:01:02.000
- [Bears Fan:] Yeah, that's the whole problem.

00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:03.750
- On my count.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:04.666
Hut, hut...HUT!

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.375
- He can't keep gettin’ away with it.

00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:11.166
- Even though I know we're gonna fall...

00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:12.916
- It's still a surprise every time.

00:01:12.916 --> 00:01:13.875
Wait, where are you going?

00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:15.291
- I'm not sure we ever drop.

00:01:15.291 --> 00:01:16.125
- AHHH!

00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:19.666
- Please stay seated for the duration of Tunnel of Love.

00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:21.375
It ain't over until I say it is.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.500
- I thought this ride was, like, supposed to be scary. 
SMH I'm out.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.250
- Oh, hell, yeah.

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.416
We're going Goff the rails, baby.

00:01:28.416 --> 00:01:29.875
- Oh, no! I dropped it. 

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:32.375
- But you held onto it for a long time though, pal.

00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:35.541
- [Announcer:] Attention:

00:01:35.541 --> 00:01:38.541
Please stop using the Giants’ line
as a turnstile.

00:01:38.541 --> 00:01:40.541
Use the actual park entrance.

00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:43.916
This is your minutely reminder
that Taylor Swift is here.

00:01:44.041 --> 00:01:45.833
Okay, back to your little games.

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:48.208
Jonathan Taylor, please report to the Colts.

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.333
Nah, I'm good.

